// Запрос переписки: если есть PSID клиента (ID_Manychat из Zoho) — прямой запрос
// его диалога; иначе перебор последних тредов inbox с пагинацией.
const q = $json.query || {};
const psid = String(q.chat_psid || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
const base = 'https://graph.facebook.com/v25.0/102435125727901/conversations?fields=id,updated_time,messages.limit(30){message,from,created_time}';
const psidMode = psid.length >= 10;
const chatUrl = psidMode ? `${base}&user_id=${psid}&limit=5` : `${base}&limit=100`;
return [{ json: { chatUrl, psidMode } }];

// Поиск переписки лида в Facebook Page Inbox.
// Вход: одна или несколько страниц ответа Graph API (нода с пагинацией).
// Совпадение: PSID-режим (диалог запрошен напрямую), телефон в тексте, или имя клиента.
const items = $input.all();
const q = $('Webhook').first().json.query || {};
const psidMode = $('Build Chat Request').first().json.psidMode === true;
const PAGE_ID = '102435125727901';

let error = '';
let convs = [];
for (const it of items) {
  const r = it.json || {};
  if (r.error) {
    const e = r.error;
    error = 'Meta: ' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 250);
    if (/access token|OAuth/i.test(error)) error += ' — check the META_PAGE_TOKEN variable in n8n';
    continue;
  }
  if (Array.isArray(r.data)) convs = convs.concat(r.data);
}

const name = String(q.chat || '').trim().toLowerCase();
const phone10 = String(q.chat_phone || '').replace(/\D/g, '').slice(-10);

const matches = [];
for (const conv of convs) {
  const msgs = ((conv.messages && conv.messages.data) || [])
    .slice()
    .sort((a, b) => new Date(a.created_time) - new Date(b.created_time));
  let customerName = '';
  let joined = '';
  for (const m of msgs) {
    if (m.from && m.from.id !== PAGE_ID && m.from.name && !customerName) customerName = m.from.name;
    joined += ' ' + (m.message || '');
  }
  const digitsInText = joined.replace(/\D/g, '');
  const phoneHit = phone10.length === 10 && digitsInText.includes(phone10);
  const cn = customerName.toLowerCase();
  const nameHit = !!name && !!cn && (cn.includes(name) || name.includes(cn));
  if (!psidMode && !phoneHit && !nameHit) continue;
  matches.push({
    conversation_id: conv.id,
    updated_time: conv.updated_time || '',
    customer: customerName,
    matched_by: psidMode ? 'profile id' : (phoneHit ? 'phone' : 'name'),
    messages: msgs.filter(m => (m.message || '').trim()).map(m => ({
      time: m.created_time || '',
      from: (m.from && m.from.id === PAGE_ID) ? 'business' : 'customer',
      name: (m.from && m.from.name) || '',
      text: m.message,
    })),
  });
}
matches.sort((a, b) => String(b.updated_time).localeCompare(String(a.updated_time)));

return [{
  json: {
    ok: !error,
    error,
    platform: 'facebook',
    searched_threads: convs.length,
    query: { name: String(q.chat || ''), phone: phone10, psid_mode: psidMode },
    found: matches.length,
    conversations: matches.slice(0, 3),
  },
}];

// Белый список Google-таблиц, доступных дашборду (все — из существующих автоматизаций)
const q = $json.query || {};
const DOCS = {
  tracker:  { id: '10Yr6hkRJK2C6PCvQ1P_t5s1VUls-LZi-1xi8N4j91Z8', title: 'DEAL CREATOR CHAT TRACKER' },
  deals:    { id: '17MGETzZ-p64JWDfb0q82xxnJ5ZdESKvS4ong2Kh45eE', title: 'DEALS TRACKER' },
  ads:      { id: '19df3TsfnNzNxE7HYcDscgcdd0RngHKfFDSfBC2AKUAE', title: 'Goals Ads Facebook Forms To CRM' },
};
const key = String(q.doc || 'tracker').toLowerCase();
const doc = DOCS[key] || DOCS.tracker;
return [{
  json: {
    docId: doc.id,
    docTitle: doc.title,
    sheetName: String(q.sheet || '').slice(0, 120),
    query: q,
  },
}];

// Список вкладок таблицы (из Google Sheets API metadata)
const meta = $('Resolve Doc').first().json;
const resp = $input.first().json || {};
let error = '';
let sheets = [];
if (resp.error) {
  const e = resp.error;
  error = 'Sheets: ' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 200);
} else {
  sheets = (resp.sheets || []).map(s => ({
    title: (s.properties && s.properties.title) || '',
    rows: (s.properties && s.properties.gridProperties && s.properties.gridProperties.rowCount) || 0,
  })).filter(s => s.title);
}
return [{ json: { ok: !error, error, doc: meta.docTitle, sheets } }];

// Строки выбранного листа -> JSON для дашборда (последние limit строк, новые сверху)
const items = $input.all();
const meta = $('Resolve Doc').first().json;
let error = '';
const rows = [];
for (const it of items) {
  const j = it.json || {};
  if (j.error) {
    const e = j.error;
    error = 'Sheets: ' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 200);
    continue;
  }
  if (Object.keys(j).length === 0) continue;
  const r = { ...j };
  delete r.row_number;
  rows.push(r);
}
let limit = parseInt(meta.query.limit, 10);
if (!Number.isFinite(limit) || limit <= 0) limit = 500;
limit = Math.min(limit, 1000);
let out = rows.slice(-limit).reverse();
const search = String(meta.query.search || '').trim().toLowerCase();
if (search) out = out.filter(r => JSON.stringify(r).toLowerCase().includes(search));

return [{
  json: {
    ok: !error,
    error,
    doc: meta.docTitle,
    sheet: meta.sheetName,
    total: rows.length,
    count: out.length,
    rows: out,
  },
}];

// Помечаем строки листа, чей телефон получал исходящий RC SMS (последние 90 дней)
const items = $input.all();
const sheet = $('Map Sheet Rows').first().json;

let rcErr = '';
const sentTo = new Set();
for (const it of items) {
  const r = it.json || {};
  if (r.error) {
    const e = r.error;
    rcErr = 'RC: ' + String(e.message || e.error_description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 150);
    continue;
  }
  for (const rec of (r.records || [])) {
    if (rec.direction !== 'Outbound') continue;
    for (const to of (rec.to || [])) {
      const d = String(to.phoneNumber || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
      if (d.length >= 10) sentTo.add(d.slice(-10));
    }
  }
}

let rows = sheet.rows || [];
let notice = '';
if (rcErr) {
  notice = 'Welcome-SMS check unavailable (' + rcErr + ')';
} else {
  rows = rows.map(r => {
    let p = '';
    for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(r)) {
      if (!/phone/i.test(k)) continue;
      const d = String(v || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
      if (d.length >= 10) { p = d.slice(-10); break; }
    }
    return { ...r, 'Welcome SMS': p && sentTo.has(p) ? '💬 sent' : '' };
  });
  notice = 'Welcome-SMS column covers RingCentral messages from the last 90 days';
}

return [{ json: { ...sheet, rows, count: rows.length, notice } }];

// Lookup: поиск лида в Zoho по телефону (варианты номера) или по имени (word search).
// Если прислали целый текст анкеты — телефон извлекается из него автоматически.
const q = $json.query || {};
const term = String(q.lookup || '').trim().slice(0, 3000);

function extractPhone(text) {
  const total = text.replace(/\D/g, '');
  if (total.length === 10) return total;
  if (total.length === 11 && total.startsWith('1')) return total.slice(1);
  for (const line of text.split(/\n+/)) {
    const l = line.replace(/[a-zA-Z0-9._%+-]+@[^\s]+/g, ' ');
    const mm = l.match(/\(?\d{3}\)?[\s.\-]\d{3}[\s.\-]\d{4}/);
    if (mm) { const d = mm[0].replace(/\D/g, ''); if (d.length === 10) return d; }
    for (const tok of l.split(/[\s,]+/)) {
      const d = tok.replace(/\D/g, '');
      if (d.length === 5 && /^\d{5}$/.test(d)) continue;
      if (tok.includes('@')) continue;
      if (/^\d{1,2}[\/.\-]\d{1,2}/.test(tok)) continue;
      if (d.length === 10) return d;
      if (d.length === 11 && d.startsWith('1')) return d.slice(1);
    }
  }
  return null;
}

const extracted = extractPhone(term);
const digits = extracted || term.replace(/\D/g, '');
let dealsUrl, contactsUrl;

if (extracted || (digits.length >= 7 && digits.length >= term.replace(/[\s()+.\-]/g, '').length - 1)) {
  const variants = new Set();
  if (digits.length === 10) {
    ['+1' + digits, digits, '1' + digits].forEach(v => variants.add(v));
  } else if (digits.length === 11 && digits.startsWith('1')) {
    const n = digits.slice(1);
    ['+1' + n, n, digits, '+' + digits].forEach(v => variants.add(v));
  } else {
    variants.add(digits);
    variants.add('+' + digits);
  }
  const crit = '(' + [...variants].map(v => `(Phone:equals:${v})`).join('or') + ')';
  const enc = encodeURIComponent(crit);
  dealsUrl = `https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v2/Deals/search?criteria=${enc}&per_page=20`;
  contactsUrl = `https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v2/Contacts/search?criteria=${enc}&per_page=20`;
} else {
  const word = encodeURIComponent(term);
  dealsUrl = `https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v2/Deals/search?word=${word}&per_page=20`;
  contactsUrl = `https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v2/Contacts/search?word=${word}&per_page=20`;
}

const phone10 = (extracted || '').slice(-10)
  || ((digits.length === 10 || digits.length === 11) ? digits.slice(-10) : '');
return [{ json: { dealsUrl, contactsUrl, term, phone10 } }];

// Сводим результаты поиска Deals + Contacts + исходящие RC SMS в один ответ
const dealsResp = $('Zoho: Lookup Deals').first().json || {};
const contactsResp = $('Zoho: Lookup Contacts').first().json || {};
const rcItems = $input.all();
const searchedPhone = String($('Build Lookup').first().json.phone10 || '');

const clean = (rec) => {
  const out = {};
  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(rec)) {
    if (k.startsWith('$')) continue;
    if (v === null || v === undefined || v === '') continue;
    if (Array.isArray(v)) {
      if (v.length) out[k] = v.map(x => (x && (x.name || x.id)) || x).join(', ');
    } else if (typeof v === 'object') {
      if (v.name) out[k] = v.name;
      else if (v.id) out[k] = v.id;
    } else {
      out[k] = v;
    }
  }
  return out;
};
const pickErr = (resp) => {
  if (resp.error) return String(resp.error.message || resp.error.description || JSON.stringify(resp.error)).slice(0, 200);
  if (resp.code && resp.message) return (resp.code + ' ' + resp.message).slice(0, 200);
  return '';
};

const deals = (Array.isArray(dealsResp.data) ? dealsResp.data : []).map(clean);
const contacts = (Array.isArray(contactsResp.data) ? contactsResp.data : []).map(clean);
const error = pickErr(dealsResp) || pickErr(contactsResp);

// --- Исходящие RingCentral SMS этому лиду ---
let rcError = '';
const rcMsgs = [];
for (const it of rcItems) {
  const r = it.json || {};
  if (r.error) {
    const e = r.error;
    rcError = 'RC: ' + String(e.message || e.error_description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 180);
    if (/token|401|assertion|invalid_grant/i.test(rcError)) rcError += ' — check the RC_JWT_ASSERTION variable in n8n';
    continue;
  }
  for (const rec of (r.records || [])) {
    if (rec.direction !== 'Outbound') continue;
    rcMsgs.push({
      time: rec.creationTime || '',
      to: (rec.to || []).map(t => String(t.phoneNumber || '').replace(/\D/g, '').slice(-10)),
      text: String(rec.subject || '').slice(0, 600),
    });
  }
}
const interest = new Set();
if (searchedPhone.length === 10) interest.add(searchedPhone);
for (const r of [...deals, ...contacts]) {
  const d = String(r.Phone || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
  if (d.length >= 10) interest.add(d.slice(-10));
}
const matched = rcMsgs
  .filter(m => m.to.some(t => interest.has(t)))
  .map(m => ({ time: m.time, text: m.text }));
matched.sort((a, b) => String(b.time).localeCompare(String(a.time)));

return [{
  json: {
    ok: !error,
    error,
    term: $('Build Lookup').first().json.term,
    deals,
    contacts,
    rc_sms: {
      checked: !rcError,
      error: rcError,
      sent: matched.length > 0,
      messages: matched.slice(0, 5),
    },
  },
}];

// Вид "Via Dashboard": вся история дашборд-лидов из журнала Google Sheets
const items = $input.all();
const q = $('Webhook').first().json.query || {};
let error = '';
let leads = [];
for (const it of items) {
  const j = it.json || {};
  if (j.error) {
    const e = j.error;
    error = 'Journal sheet error: ' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 200)
      + " — check that the 'Dashboard Leads' tab exists";
    continue;
  }
  if (!j['Added'] && !j['Phone'] && !j['First Name']) continue;
  leads.push({
    added: j['Added'] || '',
    first_name: j['First Name'] || '',
    last_name: j['Last Name'] || '',
    phone: j['Phone'] || '',
    email: j['Email'] || '',
    city: j['City'] || '',
    zip: j['ZIP'] || '',
    contact_time: j['Contact Time'] || '',
    source: j['Source'] || '',
    status: j['Status'] || '',
    deal_stage: j['Deal Stage'] || '',
    deal_id: j['Deal ID'] || '',
    via_dashboard: true,
  });
}
leads.sort((a, b) => String(b.added).localeCompare(String(a.added)));
const search = String(q.search || '').trim().toLowerCase();
if (search) leads = leads.filter(l => JSON.stringify(l).toLowerCase().includes(search));
const limit = parseInt(q.limit, 10);
if (Number.isFinite(limit) && limit > 0) leads = leads.slice(0, limit);

return [{ json: { ok: !error, error, count: leads.length, leads } }];

// Режим "Report": критерии поиска сделок по стадиям за период (по Modified_Time, NY).
// Криterии отдаём СЫРЫМИ (без encodeURIComponent) — HTTP-нода передаёт их
// через query-параметр, и n8n кодирует один раз правильно. Без between (без запятых).
const q = $json.query || {};
const NY = 'America/New_York';
const re = /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/;
const fromStr = re.test(String(q.from || '')) ? q.from : DateTime.now().setZone(NY).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');
const toStr = re.test(String(q.to || '')) ? q.to : fromStr;
const fromISO = DateTime.fromISO(fromStr, { zone: NY }).startOf('day').toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true });
const toISO = DateTime.fromISO(toStr, { zone: NY }).endOf('day').set({ millisecond: 0 }).toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true });
const mk = (stage) => `((Stage:equals:${stage})and(Modified_Time:greater_equal:${fromISO})and(Modified_Time:less_equal:${toISO}))`;
return [{
  json: {
    from: fromStr,
    to: toStr,
    quoteCriteria: mk('Quote Sent'),
    retainerCriteria: mk('Retainer Invoice Sent'),
  },
}];

// Ответ режима Report: количество Quote Sent и Retainer Invoice Sent за период
const quoteResp = $('Zoho: Quote Sent').first().json || {};
const retResp = $input.first().json || {};
const meta = $('Build Stats Query').first().json;
const pickErr = (r) => {
  if (r.error) return String(r.error.message || r.error.description || JSON.stringify(r.error)).slice(0, 200);
  if (r.code && r.message) return (r.code + ' ' + r.message).slice(0, 200);
  return '';
};
const count = (r) => (Array.isArray(r.data) ? r.data.length : 0);
const rows = (r) => (Array.isArray(r.data) ? r.data : []).map(d => ({
  deal: d.Deal_Name || '',
  contact: (d.Contact_Name && d.Contact_Name.name) || '',
  phone: d.Phone || '',
  stage: d.Stage || '',
  modified: d.Modified_Time || '',
}));
const error = pickErr(quoteResp) && pickErr(retResp) ? 'Zoho: ' + pickErr(quoteResp) : '';
return [{
  json: {
    ok: !error,
    error,
    from: meta.from,
    to: meta.to,
    quote_sent: { count: count(quoteResp), capped: count(quoteResp) >= 200, deals: rows(quoteResp).slice(0, 50) },
    retainer_sent: { count: count(retResp), capped: count(retResp) >= 200, deals: rows(retResp).slice(0, 50) },
  },
}];

// Режим "звонки за период": сырые criteria (кодирует HTTP-нода), без between.
const q = $json.query || {};
const NY = 'America/New_York';
const re = /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/;
const fromStr = re.test(String(q.calls_from || '')) ? q.calls_from : DateTime.now().setZone(NY).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');
const toStr = re.test(String(q.calls_to || '')) ? q.calls_to : fromStr;
const fromISO = DateTime.fromISO(fromStr, { zone: NY }).startOf('day').toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true });
const toISO = DateTime.fromISO(toStr, { zone: NY }).endOf('day').set({ millisecond: 0 }).toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true });

return [{
  json: {
    from: fromStr,
    to: toStr,
    scheduledCriteria: `((Call_Scheduled_Date_Time:greater_equal:${fromISO})and(Call_Scheduled_Date_Time:less_equal:${toISO}))`,
    callNowCriteria: `((Best_Contact_Time:equals:CALL NOW)and(Created_Time:greater_equal:${fromISO})and(Created_Time:less_equal:${toISO}))`,
  },
}];

// Объединяем два поиска (запланированные звонки + CALL NOW) и дедупим по id
const schedResp = $('Zoho: Calls Scheduled').first().json || {};
const nowResp = $input.first().json || {};
const pickErr = (r) => {
  if (r.error) return String(r.error.message || r.error.description || JSON.stringify(r.error)).slice(0, 200);
  if (r.code && r.message) return (r.code + ' ' + r.message).slice(0, 200);
  return '';
};
const seen = new Set();
const data = [];
for (const resp of [schedResp, nowResp]) {
  for (const d of (Array.isArray(resp.data) ? resp.data : [])) {
    if (!d || !d.id || seen.has(d.id)) continue;
    seen.add(d.id);
    data.push(d);
  }
}
const e1 = pickErr(schedResp), e2 = pickErr(nowResp);
const error = (e1 && e2) ? ('Zoho: ' + e1) : '';
return [{ json: error ? { error: { message: error } } : { data } }];

// Строим COQL-запрос к Zoho Deals с учётом query-параметров ?limit= и ?search=
const q = $json.query || {};
let limit = parseInt(q.limit, 10);
if (!Number.isFinite(limit) || limit <= 0) limit = 200;
limit = Math.min(limit, 200);
const search = String(q.search || '').replace(/['%\\]/g, '').trim().slice(0, 60);
let where = 'Created_Time is not null';
if (search) {
  where += ` and (Deal_Name like '%${search}%' or Phone like '%${search}%' or Lead_Source like '%${search}%' or Stage like '%${search}%')`;
}
const select_query = `select Deal_Name, Phone, Stage, Lead_Source, Created_Time, Zip_Code, Best_Contact_Time, Description, Contact_Name.First_Name, Contact_Name.Last_Name, Contact_Name.Email, Contact_Name.Mailing_State from Deals where ${where} order by Created_Time desc limit ${limit}`;
return [{ json: { select_query } }];

// Универсальный маппер: вход — ответ COQL (плоские ключи "Contact_Name.X")
// или REST GET /Deals (Contact_Name: {name,id}) из запасной ветки.
const resp = $input.first().json || {};
const q = $('Webhook').first().json.query || {};
let rows = Array.isArray(resp.data) ? resp.data : [];
let error = '';
if (!Array.isArray(resp.data) && Object.keys(resp).length > 0) {
  if (resp.error) {
    const e = resp.error;
    error = 'Zoho: ' + String(e.message || e.description || (typeof e === 'string' ? e : JSON.stringify(e))).slice(0, 300);
  } else if (resp.message || resp.code) {
    error = ('Zoho: ' + (resp.code || '') + ' ' + (resp.message || '')).trim();
  }
}
const g = (r, k) => {
  if (r[k] !== undefined && r[k] !== null) return r[k];
  let v = r;
  for (const p of k.split('.')) v = (v && typeof v === 'object') ? v[p] : undefined;
  return v == null ? '' : v;
};
// COQL отдаёт поля контакта; REST-фолбэк — нет (тогда Email/City не включаем вовсе,
// чтобы на дашборде не висели пустые колонки)
const coqlMode = rows.some(r => Object.keys(r).some(k => k.startsWith('Contact_Name.')));

let leads = rows.map(r => {
  let added = '';
  if (r.Created_Time) {
    const dt = DateTime.fromISO(r.Created_Time).setZone('America/New_York');
    added = dt.isValid ? dt.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') : String(r.Created_Time);
  }
  let first = String(g(r, 'Contact_Name.First_Name') || '');
  let last = String(g(r, 'Contact_Name.Last_Name') || '');
  if (!first && !last) {
    const nameSrc = (r.Contact_Name && r.Contact_Name.name) || r.Deal_Name || '';
    const parts = String(nameSrc).trim().split(/\s+/);
    first = parts.shift() || '';
    last = parts.join(' ');
  }
  const callsMode = !!(q.calls_from || q.calls_to);
  const lead = { added, first_name: first, last_name: last, phone: r.Phone || '' };
  if (callsMode) {
    const isNow = String(r.Best_Contact_Time || '').trim().toUpperCase() === 'CALL NOW';
    let callAt = '';
    if (r.Call_Scheduled_Date_Time) {
      const cd = DateTime.fromISO(r.Call_Scheduled_Date_Time).setZone('America/New_York');
      callAt = cd.isValid ? cd.toFormat('MM-dd h:mma') + ' ET' : String(r.Call_Scheduled_Date_Time);
    }
    lead.call_at = isNow ? 'CALL NOW' : callAt;
    lead.call_at_iso = r.Call_Scheduled_Date_Time || '';
    lead.call_now = isNow;
  }
  if (coqlMode) {
    lead.email = String(g(r, 'Contact_Name.Email') || '');
    lead.city = String(g(r, 'Contact_Name.Mailing_State') || '');
  }
  lead.zip = r.Zip_Code || '';
  lead.contact_time = r.Best_Contact_Time || '';
  lead.source = r.Lead_Source || '';
  lead.status = r.Stage || '';
  lead.deal_stage = r.Stage || '';
  lead.deal_id = r.id || '';
  lead.via_dashboard = /Added via Dashboard/i.test(String(r.Description || ''));
  return lead;
});
const search = String(q.search || '').trim().toLowerCase();
if (search) leads = leads.filter(l => JSON.stringify(l).toLowerCase().includes(search));
const limit = parseInt(q.limit, 10);
if (Number.isFinite(limit) && limit > 0) leads = leads.slice(0, limit);
// Режим звонков: CALL NOW сверху (свежие первыми), дальше по времени звонка
if (q.calls_from || q.calls_to) {
  leads.sort((a, b) => {
    if (a.call_now !== b.call_now) return a.call_now ? -1 : 1;
    if (a.call_now) return String(b.added).localeCompare(String(a.added));
    return String(a.call_at_iso || '9999').localeCompare(String(b.call_at_iso || '9999'));
  });
}

// Если сработал REST-фолбэк, покажем причину отказа COQL в подсказке дашборда
let notice = '';
try {
  const coqlResp = $('Zoho: COQL Query').first().json || {};
  if (coqlResp.error) {
    const e = coqlResp.error;
    notice = 'COQL unavailable (' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 160) + ') — using REST fallback without Email/City';
  }
} catch (e) { /* COQL-ноды в этом прогоне не было */ }

return [{ json: { ok: !error, error, notice, count: leads.length, leads } }];

// Готовим запрос к RingCentral message-store: окно от самого старого лида в отчёте
const mint = $input.first().json || {};
const mr = $('Map Rows').first().json;
let rcError = '';
if (!mint.access_token) {
  const e = mint.error || mint;
  rcError = 'RC auth: ' + String(e.message || e.error_description || (typeof e === 'string' ? e : JSON.stringify(e))).slice(0, 200);
  if (/invalid_grant|assertion|400/i.test(rcError)) rcError += ' — check the RC_JWT_ASSERTION variable in n8n';
}
let oldest = null;
for (const l of (mr.leads || [])) {
  const dt = DateTime.fromFormat(String(l.added || ''), 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm', { zone: 'America/New_York' });
  if (dt.isValid && (!oldest || dt < oldest)) oldest = dt;
}
const dateFrom = (oldest || DateTime.now().minus({ days: 7 })).minus({ hours: 1 }).toUTC().toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true });
return [{
  json: {
    rcError,
    token: mint.access_token || '',
    url: 'https://platform.ringcentral.com/restapi/v1.0/account/~/extension/~/message-store?messageType=SMS&direction=Outbound&perPage=250&dateFrom=' + encodeURIComponent(dateFrom),
  },
}];

// Помечаем лидов, которым был отправлен исходящий SMS через RingCentral (welcome)
const items = $input.all();
const mr = $('Map Rows').first().json;
const prep = $('Prep RC Query').first().json;
let rcErr = prep.rcError || '';

const sentTo = new Set();
for (const it of items) {
  const r = it.json || {};
  if (r.error) {
    if (!rcErr) {
      const e = r.error;
      rcErr = 'RC: ' + String(e.message || e.description || JSON.stringify(e)).slice(0, 150);
    }
    continue;
  }
  for (const rec of (r.records || [])) {
    if (rec.direction !== 'Outbound') continue;
    for (const to of (rec.to || [])) {
      const d = String(to.phoneNumber || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
      if (d.length >= 10) sentTo.add(d.slice(-10));
    }
  }
}

const leads = (mr.leads || []).map(l => {
  const p = String(l.phone || '').replace(/\D/g, '');
  const p10 = p.length >= 10 ? p.slice(-10) : '';
  return { ...l, welcome_sms: !!(p10 && sentTo.has(p10)) };
});

let notice = mr.notice || '';
if (rcErr) notice = (notice ? notice + ' · ' : '') + 'Welcome-SMS check unavailable (' + rcErr + ')';

return [{ json: { ok: mr.ok, error: mr.error, notice, count: leads.length, leads } }];
